  "structure": {
    "block_count": 74,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block_000000",
        "block_index": 0,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h1",
        "text": "The Best Energy-Boosting Pregnancy Foods to Sustain Your Strength",
        "text_sha256": "c26c213c1d4069182bb77a5b77f789e0fe52ceced4fda0bf791c113842c71953",
        "word_count": 9
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000001",
        "block_index": 1,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Light copy updates, updates to sourcing, and fact-checked for accuracy.",
        "text_sha256": "ce4b0fa95b50aecf6e7b67e3e57fba87415f35177add6e78e3c831eddc829533",
        "word_count": 10
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000002",
        "block_index": 2,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "best energy-boosting foods for pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "094a1b4c3a11cb8323a3daf57a693cf1c9c5e5996971b1c6b5d9dacd5b1cadee",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000003",
        "block_index": 3,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Boost your energy levels the old-fashioned way with these pregnancy-friendly superfoods.",
        "text_sha256": "c25746681c3108b6b3f43eca2850a47cdbf45803431439c1bb9fa15b18944326",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000004",
        "block_index": 4,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Feeling too pooped these days to do much of anything? Of course you are — you're pregnant!",
        "text_sha256": "ec3b2c3004963d27415ccca41d8d479f4f583a87f261993437d3fa859ad06cbc",
        "word_count": 17
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000005",
        "block_index": 5,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Even if you're still in the first trimester and may not yet be showing any evidence on the outside that you're busily building a baby, there's plenty going on inside — and it's all hard work, the hardest work your body has ever done.",
        "text_sha256": "952d5a4b1fcc8b18068f6e22b45cb37ef64d5f838b77dfc5261c7c07658e9b33",
        "word_count": 44
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000006",
        "block_index": 6,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "To fuel the baby-making factory that's in operation 24/7, you're producing more blood, your heart rate is up, your metabolism is burning energy overtime (even when you're lying down), and you're using up more nutrients and water. All of this contributes to the pregnancy fatigue you're likely experiencing. Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsHaving A BabySee All Sources [1]",
        "text_sha256": "2fb7077114078fe171e01beeda13ef5bd402d877eff34b2538eb876976753c4a",
        "word_count": 60
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000007",
        "block_index": 7,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsHaving A BabySee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "af06f2420c42e7e1028f0e78e8c665bdd49746d0cd64aa7d02d286cf4c2189e0",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000008",
        "block_index": 8,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "What's more, during the first trimester, your body's still in the process of manufacturing your baby's placenta (which won't be complete until the fourth month). It's not surprising that you're always fighting fatigue — and feeling like you're fighting a losing battle. Second-trimester fatigue is possible too, as well as in the third trimester as you grapple with pregnancy insomnia and your growing baby bump.",
        "text_sha256": "c7325204415302f1d9b474a69d3ed3bf3a0a3718b1d082d8da98380af21ca4ab",
        "word_count": 65
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000009",
        "block_index": 9,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "\"I’m pregnant with my first, and I was not prepared for the exhaustion,\" says What to Expect Community user ivfwarriormom88.",
        "text_sha256": "2a32e4c8f4a561df207cb747077a4348f9ac78d66243a7a8daa127c56da2819e",
        "word_count": 20
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000010",
        "block_index": 10,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "So what's an exhausted mom-to-be to do (other than crawl into bed at the first opportunity)?",
        "text_sha256": "b5774af556452d4d6972eb0b3185f2c29a88e6c18220fe3a5767bdb32083ed68",
        "word_count": 16
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000011",
        "block_index": 11,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "While you can drink coffee during pregnancy (it's safe for pregnant women to consume up to 200 milligrams of caffeine a day), it's smart to avoid sugary energy drinks or heavily caffeinated snacks. Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsModerate Caffeine Consumption During PregnancySee All Sources [2] The sugar and caffeine combo can cause a sharp rise in blood sugar — followed by a quick, deep plummet, leaving you even more tired than when you first took a sip.",
        "text_sha256": "a3ba97307781f2c6eae8b65a8dcfefda3259b3c7663e1e971266c153f70c39c4",
        "word_count": 79
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000012",
        "block_index": 12,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsModerate Caffeine Consumption During PregnancySee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "ce8d5b7dcbb7f1cb28a3fbc481c8f837e8adbbbf05f6794eb2822bb0ea4757ad",
        "word_count": 13
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000013",
        "block_index": 13,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "For an energy lift that lasts, turn to high-quality, energy-boosting foods like the ones below. Bonus: Not only will these superfoods help deliver an energy boost, but they'll add nutritional value to your day.",
        "text_sha256": "99ccee999f19b6854dfc2253122db753908f1b3e17d6fb4bf8f899343e655f23",
        "word_count": 34
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000014",
        "block_index": 14,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Key Takeaways",
        "text_sha256": "cc3f7f0f4513969e418b56fb93ec0876fd96dd6498395b04301f70dbddff8a45",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000015",
        "block_index": 15,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Pregnancy fatigue is totally normal. Your body is working overtime to grow your baby, increase blood volume, and build the placenta — all of which drain your energy, especially in the first and third trimesters.",
        "text_sha256": "177b162db5a50cd2b7cb4d3e902233cc69f4d80358ea9a204affc6befb182ccf",
        "word_count": 35
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000016",
        "block_index": 16,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "To keep energy up, skip the sugar rush. While a little caffeine is fine (up to 200 milligrams a day), avoid sugary energy drinks that cause energy crashes and fatigue.",
        "text_sha256": "3933e2981011d8c19ba9609f73703be85053fc3045ade36103234fac57f794b6",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000017",
        "block_index": 17,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fuel up smartly. Eat protein-rich foods, complex carbs, and iron-packed options — like lean meats, beans, eggs, and whole grains — to sustain your energy and support your baby’s development.",
        "text_sha256": "bb5fa3793644b2fa20e63dade98159135c6e00757926be3ce628f01c117f75d5",
        "word_count": 30
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000018",
        "block_index": 18,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h2",
        "text": "Best energy-boosting foods during pregnancy",
        "text_sha256": "bad4cfe5a23a8b7181f881a095126e890def3c362d399c3e48a0e8acc7307231",
        "word_count": 5
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000019",
        "block_index": 19,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Here's the lowdown on foods that will give you a lift that lasts: Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsNutrition During PregnancySee All Sources [3]",
        "text_sha256": "598bd8510f8984a9903675d13a1c69b2cd139de7229dfa70f6fa472b1e20cac1",
        "word_count": 25
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000020",
        "block_index": 20,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Trusted SourceAmerican College of Obstetricians and GynecologistsNutrition During PregnancySee All Sources",
        "text_sha256": "2f4f8d74aebf7be67f78ef9d130ef2ef5456265c2183d3635059a87cc6f14f6c",
        "word_count": 11
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000021",
        "block_index": 21,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "1. Protein-rich foods",
        "text_sha256": "919270e87fea9df01a77bf49347ea59112aff7b3da97fe2edeeb101330367f7d",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000022",
        "block_index": 22,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Protein is essential during pregnancy , and it's also nature's ultimate pick-me-up. It provides you with the kind of energy that keeps you going — instead of leaving you flat in the middle of the day.",
        "text_sha256": "79f3acddffeb949891700b79c6a774638f05b3a7bf7dd918413f5d435acf89cc",
        "word_count": 36
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000023",
        "block_index": 23,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Better still, the amino acids in protein-rich foods will also aid in the development of your baby's rapidly reproducing cells. You need approximately 71 grams of it per day when you're expecting.",
        "text_sha256": "00c6a88b9d47b6494a9bfedd63c9d014648455b7c1ac4add1887c22d82369751",
        "word_count": 32
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000024",
        "block_index": 24,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "You can find healthy sources of protein in:",
        "text_sha256": "0f74af0131831654e9f88cea8a50396614ff82814e717f2dfdd803e66fba5fd0",
        "word_count": 8
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000025",
        "block_index": 25,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Milk",
        "text_sha256": "8189b8409b18b1ef215ec2f2d8da515cdc7cc21a4b7cd35482b66bede2275d02",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000026",
        "block_index": 26,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Cheese",
        "text_sha256": "6e5a59d4fd56f798e609d28e3d6300b2d80bfbb76d27711c0c24006a129d4e17",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000027",
        "block_index": 27,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Eggs",
        "text_sha256": "f1c1f57728f932efde20e53703ee5f96b1cebdc15b8578b7faa727c89dbfe03f",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000028",
        "block_index": 28,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Lean meat",
        "text_sha256": "37f8196bd370340500c5e9b2da061720ddedfda6ab0114cd181fbd023f2a0458",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000029",
        "block_index": 29,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Poultry",
        "text_sha256": "174291cef306566c4fbfd93b1a4997efe70c199783e134ff0cc09d2c1d340588",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000030",
        "block_index": 30,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fish and seafood",
        "text_sha256": "e1e0d5c377a80653d6ede6efbefab71cc563ddce5bd0d807adb5fea75857ff4b",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000031",
        "block_index": 31,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Tofu and soy products (soy pasta, edamame)",
        "text_sha256": "a16a952b1af2ec088d54e029a16d51eca42adc47587d922958f5bb8fc889a7b4",
        "word_count": 7
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000032",
        "block_index": 32,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Beans, lentils, split peas",
        "text_sha256": "910f898b566df63d9ebe2e15ca854862d8c26b97666de707cc2cc77fb0b2a041",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000033",
        "block_index": 33,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Quinoa",
        "text_sha256": "5df56fd846d74360499e65aec6be62b979a4dcda69a4f374d74c08238e100cb3",
        "word_count": 1
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000034",
        "block_index": 34,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Nuts and seeds",
        "text_sha256": "23c9cab158508816394e97539b03b8a57a6ac9c14f6abd77d4c3cd1cf2ca7fe8",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000035",
        "block_index": 35,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Peanut butter",
        "text_sha256": "90ab90769a3f02c6a6700ba7d49bea3e48281ce5f0a7e29a020459cfb5dcc103",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000036",
        "block_index": 36,
        "block_type": "heading",
        "tag": "h3",
        "text": "2. Complex carbohydrates",
        "text_sha256": "f573b1443924bb0487a8bd13e6761883f1b9fcb967678802c2c03ed1fecc43d5",
        "word_count": 3
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000037",
        "block_index": 37,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Has the word carb become a four letter one in your diet plan? Redefine it by choosing healthy complex carbohydrates that nourish your baby and fuel your energy needs.",
        "text_sha256": "b3cc377d32879c32ab3bc293e22ddd5259b0fcb233aebe513484fe6bf2b31ea4",
        "word_count": 29
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000038",
        "block_index": 38,
        "block_type": "p",
        "tag": "p",
        "text": "Check out this list of healthy carb options that reads like the roster of a nutritional all-star team:",
        "text_sha256": "af18b06a0794752d98720c64ac46fa8061adc580c1754a44d22d3e4d2d0c591e",
        "word_count": 18
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000039",
        "block_index": 39,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fresh fruits",
        "text_sha256": "324a4db2dea334d733744c4cadbc0f310a70d7447c2bdf8c1708919506ec259b",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000040",
        "block_index": 40,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Dried and freeze-dried fruits",
        "text_sha256": "ce4c2e66faa591aecad9f6a0425970878e67b018679d8f8b000dd590b89472e4",
        "word_count": 4
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000041",
        "block_index": 41,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Fresh vegetables",
        "text_sha256": "0e6d909dbf9404289f5fd204df48db6b385dda9a038aa5dfd5ab08f077af3e12",
        "word_count": 2
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block_000042",
        "block_index": 42,
        "block_type": "li",
        "tag": "li",
        "text": "Whole grain breads, crackers, and cereals",
        "text_sha256": "8ce10b21f8f72a3a5fd20fff41580905086bc629d1aa8824a22f33d0122a6f75",
        "word_count": 6
      },
      {
